  "label": "Government Jail Consequence",
  "description": "The phrase 'our government will put you in jail' references the legal system and the concept of state punishment for criminal acts. This is a real-world legal concept that the meme uses to contrast with the implied violence, suggesting that even if someone commits violent acts, they will be punished by the state. This is a common trope in memes that portray individuals as dangerous but ultimately accountable to the law.",
